            "review_title": "Review at Tonda Pizza Vietnam - Crescent Mall Quận 7",
            "review_text": "prakash mjumdar\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam18 contributions\n0\nHorrible service & 1.30 hours to serve without informing\nJan 2022 • Family\nI visited Tonda Piza in Tan Phu ward , Phu My Hung, hcmc. We waited one hour then served only one pizza. We had 3 other dishes and waiting. When asked , they inforemed that it will takes another minimum 30 to 45 min to serve another food. \nWe paid for the pizza and leave without eating other dishes and went to other restaurant.\n\nWe were not informed that it will take minimum one and half hour to serve our order.\n\nPlease check before going if your orders will be served or not.\n\nRecommend to avoid if you are hungry.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 8, 2022",
